### 3. GameView.java (Rendering, Assets Loading & Collision Logic)
This file contains the main gameplay loop. It renders the custom bus image, tracks movement, sets up Bangladeshi roads/buildings, and triggers the hydraulic horn audio when touched.

```java
package com.bdbus.simulator;

import android.content.Context;
import android.graphics.Bitmap;
